  <entry>
    <title>Linux下C静态库、动态库</title>
    <link href="/2025/11/25/C-static-and-dynamic-libraries-under-linux/"/>
    <url>/2025/11/25/C-static-and-dynamic-libraries-under-linux/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="静态库"><a href="#静态库" class="headerlink" title="静态库"></a>静态库</h2><p>静态库是在编译时被完整复制到可执行文件中的库文件，以<code>.a</code>为扩展名。在Linux中，静态库实际上是多个目标文件（<code>.o</code>文件）的归档集合。</p><h3 id="创建静态库"><a href="#创建静态库" class="headerlink" title="创建静态库"></a>创建静态库</h3><ol><li><strong>编译源文件为目标文件</strong></li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">gcc -c math_functions.c -o math_functions.o<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="2"><li><strong>创建静态库</strong></li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">ar rcs libmath.a math_functions.o<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><code>ar</code>是归档工具</li><li><code>r</code>：替换或添加文件到归档中</li><li><code>c</code>：创建归档文件（如果不存在）</li><li><code>s</code>：创建归档索引</li></ul><h3 id="使用静态库"><a href="#使用静态库" class="headerlink" title="使用静态库"></a>使用静态库</h3><ol><li><strong>编译时链接静态库</strong></li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">gcc main.c -L. -lmath -o program<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><code>-L.</code>：指定库文件搜索路径（当前目录）</li><li><code>-lmath</code>：链接名为libmath.a的库（注意：去掉lib和.a前缀后缀）</li></ul><ol start="2"><li><strong>查看静态库内容</strong></li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">ar t libmath.a        <span class="hljs-comment"># 列出库中的目标文件</span><br>nm libmath.a          <span class="hljs-comment"># 显示库中的符号</span><br>ar x libmath.a        <span class="hljs-comment"># 提取库中的目标文件</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="静态库特点"><a href="#静态库特点" class="headerlink" title="静态库特点"></a>静态库特点</h3><ul><li><p><strong>优点</strong>：</p><ul><li>程序移植方便，不需要额外安装库文件</li><li>运行时没有外部依赖</li><li>程序启动速度快</li></ul></li><li><p><strong>缺点</strong>：</p><ul><li>多个程序使用同一库会浪费内存（每个程序都包含一份）</li><li>更新库需要重新编译所有使用该库的程序</li><li>可执行文件体积较大</li></ul></li></ul><h2 id="动态库"><a href="#动态库" class="headerlink" title="动态库"></a>动态库</h2><p>动态库（也称为共享库）是在程序运行时才被加载到内存中的库文件，以<code>.so</code>为扩展名。多个程序可以共享同一个动态库，节省内存空间。</p><h3 id="创建动态库"><a href="#创建动态库" class="headerlink" title="创建动态库"></a>创建动态库</h3><ol><li><strong>编译位置无关代码（PIC）</strong></li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">gcc -fPIC -c math_functions.c -o math_functions.o<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><code>-fPIC</code>：生成位置无关代码，这是创建动态库必需的</li></ul><ol start="2"><li><strong>创建动态库</strong></li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">gcc -shared -o libmath.so math_functions.o<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><code>-shared</code>：创建共享库</li></ul><h3 id="使用动态库"><a href="#使用动态库" class="headerlink" title="使用动态库"></a>使用动态库</h3><ol><li><strong>编译时链接动态库</strong></li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">gcc main.c -L. -lmath -o program<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="2"><li><strong>运行时设置库路径</strong></li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 方法1：添加到LD_LIBRARY_PATH环境变量</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span> LD_LIBRARY_PATH=.:<span class="hljs-variable">$LD_LIBRARY_PATH</span><br>./program<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 方法2：使用rpath（编译时指定）</span><br>gcc main.c -L. -Wl,-rpath,. -lmath -o program<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 方法3：使用ldconfig（系统级配置）</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">cp</span> libmath.so /usr/local/lib/<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> ldconfig<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="3"><li><strong>查看动态库信息</strong></li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">ldd program          <span class="hljs-comment"># 查看程序依赖的动态库</span><br>readelf -d program   <span class="hljs-comment"># 查看程序的动态段信息</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="4"><li><p><strong>动态库搜索路径顺序</strong></p><p>动态链接器（ld.so）按照以下顺序搜索动态库：</p><ol><li><strong>程序头中指定的DT_RPATH</strong>（如果设置了<code>DT_RUNPATH</code>则此项不生效）</li><li><strong>环境变量LD_LIBRARY_PATH</strong></li><li><strong>程序头中指定的DT_RUNPATH</strong></li><li><strong>&#x2F;etc&#x2F;ld.so.cache缓存</strong>（由ldconfig生成）</li><li><strong>默认系统路径</strong>：<code>/lib</code>, <code>/usr/lib</code>（在64位系统上还包括<code>/lib64</code>, <code>/usr/lib64</code>）</li></ol><p><strong>注意</strong>：DT_RPATH和DT_RUNPATH的区别</p><ul><li>DT_RPATH：优先级高于LD_LIBRARY_PATH</li><li>DT_RUNPATH：优先级低于LD_LIBRARY_PATH（推荐使用）</li></ul><p>创建动态库时控制rpath行为：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 现代GCC/glibc默认创建DT_RUNPATH（推荐）</span><br>gcc -Wl,-rpath,/path/to/lib main.c -lmylib -o program<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 强制使用DT_RPATH（不推荐，优先级过高）</span><br>gcc -Wl,-rpath,/path/to/lib -Wl,--disable-new-dtags main.c -lmylib -o program<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 明确指定使用DT_RUNPATH</span><br>gcc -Wl,-rpath,/path/to/lib -Wl,--enable-new-dtags main.c -lmylib -o program<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>验证rpath类型</strong>：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 查看程序动态段信息</span><br>readelf -d program | grep -E <span class="hljs-string">&quot;(RPATH|RUNPATH)&quot;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 输出示例：</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 0x000000000000000f (RPATH)              Library rpath: [/path/to/lib]</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 0x000000000000001d (RUNPATH)            Library runpath: [/path/to/lib]</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>使用$ORIGIN实现相对路径</strong>：</p><p><code>$ORIGIN</code>是一个特殊的动态链接器变量，代表包含程序或库的目录。这使得程序可以在不同的安装位置找到其动态库：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 库文件和程序在同一目录</span><br>gcc -Wl,-rpath,<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;$ORIGIN&#x27;</span> main.c -lmylib -o program<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 库文件在程序的lib子目录</span><br>gcc -Wl,-rpath,<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;$ORIGIN/lib&#x27;</span> main.c -lmylib -o program<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 库文件在程序的../lib目录</span><br>gcc -Wl,-rpath,<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;$ORIGIN/../lib&#x27;</span> main.c -lmylib -o program<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 多个相对路径</span><br>gcc -Wl,-rpath,<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;$ORIGIN:$ORIGIN/lib:$ORIGIN/../shared_libs&#x27;</span> main.c -lmylib -o program<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>$ORIGIN的优势</strong>：</p><ul><li><strong>可移植性</strong>：程序可以安装到任意路径，无需修改rpath</li><li><strong>自包含部署</strong>：应用程序可以携带自己的库文件</li><li><strong>开发便利</strong>：开发环境和生产环境使用相同的相对路径结构</li></ul><p><strong>使用<code>patchelf</code>在编译后修改二进制文件的rpath</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 查看rpath</span><br>patchelf --print-rpath program<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 设置rpath</span><br>patchelf --set-rpath <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;$ORIGIN/lib&#x27;</span> program<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 添加rpath</span><br>patchelf --add-rpath <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;$ORIGIN/../shared&#x27;</span> program<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 删除rpath</span><br>patchelf --remove-rpath program<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li></ol><h3 id="动态库版本管理"><a href="#动态库版本管理" class="headerlink" title="动态库版本管理"></a>动态库版本管理</h3><p>Linux中的动态库通常使用版本号来管理兼容性：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 创建带版本号的动态库</span><br>gcc -shared -Wl,-soname,libmath.so.1 -o libmath.so.1.0 math_functions.o<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 创建符号链接</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">ln</span> -s libmath.so.1.0 libmath.so.1<br><span class="hljs-built_in">ln</span> -s libmath.so.1 libmath.so<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><strong>major版本</strong>：API不兼容的重大改变</li><li><strong>minor版本</strong>：新增功能，向后兼容</li><li><strong>patch版本</strong>：bug修复，向后兼容</li></ul><h3 id="动态库特点"><a href="#动态库特点" class="headerlink" title="动态库特点"></a>动态库特点</h3><ul><li><p><strong>优点</strong>：</p><ul><li>多个程序共享同一库，节省内存</li><li>更新库无需重新编译程序（保持API兼容性）</li><li>可执行文件体积较小</li></ul></li><li><p><strong>缺点</strong>：</p><ul><li>程序运行时需要外部依赖</li><li>程序移植相对复杂</li><li>启动时需要加载动态库，稍慢一些</li><li>版本兼容性问题需要注意</li></ul></li></ul><h2 id="静态库-vs-动态库比较"><a href="#静态库-vs-动态库比较" class="headerlink" title="静态库 vs 动态库比较"></a>静态库 vs 动态库比较</h2><table><thead><tr><th>特性</th><th>静态库</th><th>动态库</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>文件大小</strong></td><td>大（库包含在程序中）</td><td>小（程序中只有引用）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>内存使用</strong></td><td>高（每个进程独立加载）</td><td>低（多进程共享同一库）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>运行时依赖</strong></td><td>无</td><td>有（需要相应的.so文件）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>更新方式</strong></td><td>需重新编译程序</td><td>只需替换.so文件（API兼容）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>启动速度</strong></td><td>快</td><td>稍慢（需要加载库）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>移植性</strong></td><td>好（单一文件）</td><td>差（需要配套库文件）</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="实际示例"><a href="#实际示例" class="headerlink" title="实际示例"></a>实际示例</h2><p>让我们通过一个完整的示例来演示静态库和动态库的使用。</p><h3 id="示例代码"><a href="#示例代码" class="headerlink" title="示例代码"></a>示例代码</h3><p><strong>math_functions.h</strong></p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">ifndef</span> MATH_FUNCTIONS_H</span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">define</span> MATH_FUNCTIONS_H</span><br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">add</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> a, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> b)</span>;<br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">subtract</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> a, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> b)</span>;<br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">multiply</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> a, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> b)</span>;<br><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">endif</span> <span class="hljs-comment">// MATH_FUNCTIONS_H</span></span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>math_functions.c</strong></p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;math_functions.h&quot;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">add</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> a, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> b)</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> a + b;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">subtract</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> a, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> b)</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> a - b;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">multiply</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> a, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> b)</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> a * b;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>main.c</strong></p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;math_functions.h&quot;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> a = <span class="hljs-number">10</span>, b = <span class="hljs-number">5</span>;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;加法: %d + %d = %d\n&quot;</span>, a, b, add(a, b));<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;减法: %d - %d = %d\n&quot;</span>, a, b, subtract(a, b));<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;乘法: %d * %d = %d\n&quot;</span>, a, b, multiply(a, b));<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="创建和使用静态库"><a href="#创建和使用静态库" class="headerlink" title="创建和使用静态库"></a>创建和使用静态库</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 1. 编译源文件为目标文件</span><br>gcc -c math_functions.c -o math_functions.o<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 2. 创建静态库</span><br>ar rcs libmath.a math_functions.o<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 3. 编译主程序并链接静态库</span><br>gcc main.c -L. -lmath -o program_static<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 4. 运行程序</span><br>./program_static<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="创建和使用动态库"><a href="#创建和使用动态库" class="headerlink" title="创建和使用动态库"></a>创建和使用动态库</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 1. 编译位置无关代码</span><br>gcc -fPIC -c math_functions.c -o math_functions.o<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 2. 创建动态库</span><br>gcc -shared -o libmath.so math_functions.o<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 3. 编译主程序并链接动态库</span><br>gcc main.c -L. -lmath -o program_dynamic<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 4. 运行程序（需要设置库路径）</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span> LD_LIBRARY_PATH=.:<span class="hljs-variable">$LD_LIBRARY_PATH</span><br>./program_dynamic<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="比较结果"><a href="#比较结果" class="headerlink" title="比较结果"></a>比较结果</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 查看文件大小</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">ls</span> -l program_static program_dynamic<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 查看动态库依赖</span><br>ldd program_dynamic<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>你会看到：</p><ul><li><code>program_static</code> 文件较大，没有外部库依赖</li><li><code>program_dynamic</code> 文件较小，依赖于 <code>libmath.so</code></li></ul>]]></content>
    
    
